                    {
                        "sense_id": "c51fed0a-5be9-3aa4-b0c9-d8127d964d4c",
                        "entry_id": "0655b4d3-29e7-3082-a2fe-83f1888bae5e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To cause a substance to undergo metabolism."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0babcacf-abf1-45ee-ba69-0807c7f33390",
                                "sense_id": "c51fed0a-5be9-3aa4-b0c9-d8127d964d4c",
                                "text": "Among the many types of juice, grapefruit stands out from the pack because it changes the way some people absorb and metabolize different drugs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3a7207b6-ab74-4f99-808f-72eabc1b9f49",
                                "sense_id": "c51fed0a-5be9-3aa4-b0c9-d8127d964d4c",
                                "text": "The genes in question encode two enzymes that metabolize alcohol and its breakdown products; the two enzymes are known as alcohol dehydrogenase and aldehyde dehydrogenase."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0a54a551-d6a5-3f1c-978d-12c08ce9c3d3",
                        "entry_id": "0655b4d3-29e7-3082-a2fe-83f1888bae5e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To produce a substance using metabolism."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b32b76c3-ab12-368f-ae19-204cf71a98dc",
                        "entry_id": "0655b4d3-29e7-3082-a2fe-83f1888bae5e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To absorb and process as if by metabolism."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly",
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8b4df023-1692-47e5-8536-068705e3c05f",
                                "sense_id": "b32b76c3-ab12-368f-ae19-204cf71a98dc",
                                "text": "We believe this to be the true way to teach zoölogy, for we doubt the value to a man of a mass of indefinite ill-digested text-book information. Occasionally an omnivore can take in every thin, and digest and so metabolize it as to organize it into healthy mental tissue. They are, however, the few."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
